{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-28",
  "title": "Features",
  "author": "person:studio-lafa-llc:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Features"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Standard Features (Free)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Drug Information**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Drug Monographs**: Comprehensive information on prescription and over-the-counter drugs, including dosing, adverse reactions, contraindications, and warnings."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Drug Interactions Checker**: Allows users to check for interactions between up to 30 drugs simultaneously."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Pill Identifier**: Identifies medications based on visual characteristics (shape, color, imprint)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Formulary Information**: Provides drug coverage and cost-saving alternatives based on insurance plans."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Calculators and Tools**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Medical Calculators**: Includes over 40 calculators such as BMI, CrCl (creatinine clearance), and renal function estimators."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Lab Reference Values**: Offers normal lab result ranges and guidelines for common tests."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Disease and Condition Reference**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Disease Information**: Basic information about common conditions and their treatment options, including symptoms and management guidelines."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Evidence-Based Medicine**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Clinical Practice Guidelines**: Summarized guidelines based on current medical research for managing specific conditions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Medical News and Updates**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Drug and Industry News**: Timely updates on the latest in drug approvals, recalls, and medical industry news."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. **Multimedia**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Pill Images**: Visual aids to identify medications based on their appearance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "7. **Personalization and Customization**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Favorites**: Create a personalized list of frequently accessed drugs, calculators, or guidelines."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Notes**: Ability to annotate or add notes to entries for future reference."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Syncing Across Devices**: Content can be synced across multiple devices for seamless access to personal lists and notes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "8. **Other Features**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Clinical Search**: Fast and intuitive search for drugs, conditions, guidelines, calculators, and formulary information."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Dosing Calculations**: Basic dosing tools that help adjust dosages based on age, weight, renal function, etc."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Tables and Protocols**: Quick access to tables and protocols, including immunization schedules, treatment protocols, and more."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Citations:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[1] [https://www.epocrates.com/features](https://www.epocrates.com/features)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Premium Features (Epocrates Plus)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "*(Requires Paid Subscription)*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Drug Information**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Alternative Medications**: Detailed information on alternative and non-prescription therapies, including herbal and dietary supplements."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Disease and Condition Reference**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Infectious Disease Treatment Guide**: Detailed reference for diagnosing and treating infectious diseases, including pathogen-specific information."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Diagnostic Tools**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Diagnostic Labs**: Provides in-depth guidance for ordering and interpreting lab tests, including differential diagnosis based on lab results."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Evidence-Based Medicine**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Evidence-Based Disease Content**: Expanded, detailed guidelines for diagnosing and treating a wide range of conditions, including differential diagnoses and treatment options."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Specialty Clinical Guidelines**: Specialty-specific guidelines, including more niche or rare medical conditions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Clinical Decision-Making Tools**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Advanced Dosing Calculators**: More sophisticated tools to adjust drug dosages based on clinical factors, with additional guidelines for complex patients."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Pathogen Treatment Guide**: Detailed reference for specific pathogens and the antimicrobial therapies required to treat them."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Citations:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[2] [https://www.epocrates.com/plus](https://www.epocrates.com/plus)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Premium Feature (Epocrates Plus Group)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Epocrates+ Group** offers additional features designed for healthcare teams or organizations, beyond what is available to individual subscribers. This is an enhanced version of **Epocrates Plus**, which provides group-wide access and collaboration tools. Here's what **Epocrates+ Group** typically includes:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Epocrates+ Group Features**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Enterprise Access**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Provides **group-wide access** to the premium features of Epocrates Plus for hospitals, healthcare organizations, clinics, or medical schools."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Teams can ensure that all members have the same clinical tools and resources for consistent decision-making."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Collaborative Features**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Shared Formulary Information**: Organizations can add and customize formulary lists, allowing all team members to see formulary information specific to their organization or institution."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Centralized Updates**: Administrators can distribute critical updates (e.g., new treatment protocols or guidelines) to the entire group, ensuring consistency in clinical practice."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Administrative Tools**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **User Management**: Administrators can manage licenses and assign them to different users within the organization."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-56",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Analytics and Reporting**: Organizations can track usage across the group to ensure that the clinical tools are being used effectively."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-57",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Custom Content**: Organizations may be able to add custom resources or protocols specific to their institution that all users can access through the platform."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Enhanced Premium Features**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Full access to all premium content in **Epocrates Plus**, including advanced drug information, disease content, diagnostic tools, and more."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Customizable Notifications**: Group-level notifications and alerts can be customized and sent to users, helping to distribute critical information quickly."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Benefits for Organizations**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-65",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-62",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Cost-Effective Licensing**: Rather than individual subscriptions, group licensing can provide a more cost-effective solution for larger teams."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-63",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Consistent Medical Information**: All team members have access to the same up-to-date guidelines and drug information, reducing the risk of inconsistencies in care."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-64",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Team Collaboration**: Group-specific tools and updates can be disseminated easily, improving overall efficiency and communication within the healthcare setting."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-66",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Epocrates+ Group** is typically used by healthcare institutions, medical schools, and large practices to standardize the clinical tools used by their staff and ensure everyone is working with the most up-to-date information."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Citations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[3] [https://www.epocrates.com/plus/group](https://www.epocrates.com/plus/group)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "New Features ImhotepRX Offers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **3D Visual Diagnostic Tool and Educational Content**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "-"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Focus on African Patient Presentations**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-73",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- High-quality and diverse pathological images and case studies tailored to African healthcare contexts, highlighting diseases as they present in African populations."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-74",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Unique diagnostic methods and case studies contributed by African physicians."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Counterfeit Drug Verification System**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- A feature to verify the authenticity of drugs by scanning barcodes or entering batch numbers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Real-time integration with national drug regulatory agencies to combat counterfeit drugs in Africa."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Physician Collaboration and Networking**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- A secure forum for healthcare professionals to discuss cases, share experiences, and seek advice from peers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Anonymized patient data sharing for educational purposes, with a focus on maintaining privacy and ethical standards."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Offline Access to Critical Information**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- While both apps offer some offline functionality, ImhotepRx emphasizes offline access specifically tailored to regions with limited internet connectivity, particularly in African healthcare settings."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Citations:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[4] ImhotepRX Business Document"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[ImhotepRx...pdf](Features/ImhotepRx...pdf)"
        }
      ]
    },
